#. i18n: file: kmymoney2/plugins/ofximport/dialogs/konlinebankingsetupdecl.ui:72
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (K3ListView, m_listFi)
#: rc.cpp:4846
msgid "Financial Institution"
